/* Windows resource file — only used by the MinGW build via windres.
 * Icon ID 1 is the default the OS picks for the .exe icon (in
 * Explorer / file listings) and SDL2 picks for the window/taskbar
 * icon when no explicit SDL_SetWindowIcon() has been called.
 *
 * The 16x16 SWOS.ico in the project root is the source. */
1 ICON "SWOS.ico"
